"\"><b>Application for Modular Exemption</b></font></a></span>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><div><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" style=\"\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#011178\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" class=\"\"> </font><font class=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" class=\"\"> </font></font></font></font></font></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\">Application must be submitted at least 2 months before registration for the examination and must be submitted individually. </font></font></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\">Failure to comply with the above conditions will result in your application not being processed in time for the </font></font></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\">examination. </font></font></span><br>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\"><br></font></font></span></div>\n<!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><div><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font color=\"#011ca0\" class=\"\"><br></font></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font color=\"#011ca0\" class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Option C</font></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#999999\"></font></span></div>\n<div><div style=\"text-align: start; line-height: normal;\"><font style=\"line-height: 1.2em;\"><font color=\"#011ca0\" class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 16px;\"></span></font></font></div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 14px;\">\n<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 16px; text-align: start;\">_________________</span><!--EndFragment--><br>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 14px;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 14px;\">Only Malaysians who possess the following qualifications or professional credentials with 3 years relevant work experience in personal finance* are eligible to apply. Exemption is for Modules 1 to 4 of the certification. Applicants are allowed only 3 consecutive attempts under this option (terms &amp; conditions apply).<br>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 14px;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 14px;\">\n<!--StartFragment--><img src=\"{IMAGE_URL}/1719215171209rvcopy_1767666990.jpg?n=1767666990548set\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" class=\"\" style=\"width: 694px; height: 241px;\">\n</div></font></font><div><br></div>\n<div>\n<font style=\"font-size: 12px;\" color=\"#000000\" class=\"\">* personal finance related experience can be in any of the following areas: insurance, mutual funds, securities, asset management, accounting, estate planning, banking, taxation, trusts, retirement planning and financial planning and must be within the 5 years prior to application</font><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<font class=\"\"><font class=\"\"><div>\n<!--StartFragment--><div>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(21, 34, 129); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;\">&nbsp;› </span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#011178\"><font class=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://fpam.org.my/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Application-for-Challenge-Status-v-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\" style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Click here</font> </a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- </span></font></font></font></font></span><span style=\"text-align: start; background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0);\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://www.fpam.org.my/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Application-for-Challenge-Status-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\"><font color=\"#011178\" class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>Application for Challenge Status </b></font></a></span>\n</div>\n<!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><div><span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#080808\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></font></font></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#080808\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Application must be submitted at least 2 months before registration for the examination and must be submitted individually. </font></font></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#080808\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Failure to comply with the above conditions will result in your application not being processed in time for the </font></font></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(50, 40, 40, 0); text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#080808\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">examination. </font></font></span>\n</div>\n<!--EndFragment-->\n\n<!--EndFragment-->\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>\n<!--StartFragment--><font style=\"font-size: 20px;\" color=\"#011178\" class=\"\"><b style=\"\">\n\n</b></font>\n</div>\n<!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><div>\n<img src=\"{IMAGE_URL}/1719215171209rvcopy_1767752683.jpg?n=1767752683620set\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" style=\"\" class=\"\"><div class=\"clea