                                                                                                                                           <!-- Set Background of Design block -->\n             <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center \"> <!-- Set Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n                 <div class=\"uk-grid uk-grid-small ui-sortable\" data-uk-grid-margin=\"\">\n                    \n                 </div>\n             </div>\n         </div>\n         </div>\n        </div><div class=\"mg\">\n        <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center rv-block-full\"> <!-- Set Row Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n         <div class=\"rvsb_design_block bgContent\" style=\"background-color: rgb(7, 0, 70);\">                                                                                                                                                                                                               <!-- Set Background of Design block -->\n             <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center \"> <!-- Set Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n                 <div class=\"uk-grid uk-grid-small ui-sortable\" data-uk-grid-margin=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"uk-width-small-1-1 uk-row-first\" style=\"\">\n                        <div id=\"editable_area_custom66648611691f130f189652cbe3a42a3c0\" data-ph=\"Editable Area. Backspace tab to remove this block.\" class=\"RVWYSIWYGAREA areaCustom\" designmode=\"off\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<font style=\"\" color=\"#ffffff\" class=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER CERTIFICATION PROGRAMME&nbsp;</font><b> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font><font style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</font></font><font style=\"\"><b style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></b><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/r/month\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\" style=\"\"><b style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</b></a></font>\n</div>     \n                    </div>\n                 </div>\n             </div>\n         </div>\n         </div>\n        </div><div class=\"mg\">\n        <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center rv-block-full\"> <!-- Set Row Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n         <div class=\"rvsb_design_block bgContent\">                                                                                                                                                                     <!-- Set Background of Design block -->\n             <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center \"> <!-- Set Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n                 <div class=\"uk-grid uk-grid-small ui-sortable\" data-uk-grid-margin=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"uk-width-small-1-1 uk-row-first\" style=\"\">\n                        <div id=\"editable_area_custom404c1f211f3c470012d243ed30d831950\" data-ph=\"Editable Area. Backspace tab to remove this block.\" class=\"RVWYSIWYGAREA areaCustom\" designmode=\"off\" style=\"display: block;\"><br></div>     \n                    </div>\n                 </div>\n             </div>\n         </div>\n         </div>\n        </div><div class=\"mg\">\n        <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center rv-block-full\"> <!-- Set Row Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n         <div class=\"rvsb_design_block bgContent\">                                                                                                                                                                                                                       <!-- Set Background of Design block -->\n             <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center \"> <!-- Set Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n                 <div class=\"uk-grid uk-grid-small ui-sortable\" data-uk-grid-margin=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"uk-width-small-1-1 uk-row-first\" style=\"\">\n                        <div id=\"editable_area_customac0ef03b3744b0a43dcbd20f2b8a9f3b00\" data-ph=\"Editable Area. Backspace tab to remove this block.\" class=\"RVWYSIWYGAREA areaCustom\" designmode=\"off\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<p class=\"rv-text-center\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.2em;\"><font style=\"color: rgb(39, 23, 164); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></font></p>\n<p class=\"rv-text-center\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.2em;\"><font color=\"#192797\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 28px;\" face=\"Georgia\">Certified Financial Planner<sup style=\"\">TM&nbsp;</sup>(CFP<sup style=\"\">®</sup>) Certification Programme</font></font></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.2em;\" class=\"rv-text-center\"><font style=\"\"><font style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4em; font-weight: normal;\" color=\"#080808\">CFP®, CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER® and CFP® are certification marks owned outside the United States by Financial Planning Standards Board Ltd. FPAM is the marks   licensing authority for the CFP Marks in Malaysia, through agreement with FPSB. \n\nUTAR does not certify individuals to use the CFP, CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER and CFP       marks. CFP certification is granted only by FPSB and FPAM to those persons who, in addition to completing an educational requirement offered by this FPAM-approved              Education Provider, have met the ethics, experience and examination requirements.</font></font></font></p>\n        </div>     \n                    </div>\n                 </div>\n             </div>\n         </div>\n         </div>\n        </div><div class=\"mg\">\n        <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center rv-block-full\"> <!-- Set Row Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n         <div class=\"rvsb_design_block bgContent\">                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       <!-- Set Background of Design block -->\n             <div class=\"uk-container uk-container-center \"> <!-- Set Full width must use class  of Design block -->\n                 <div class=\"uk-grid-margin\"></div>\n                 <div class=\"uk-grid ui-sortable\">\n                     \n                     <div class=\"uk-width-medium-3-4\" style=\"position: relative;\">\n                        <div class=\"rv-panel-box RVWYSIWYGAREA areaCustom\" id=\"editable_area_custom1b9eee08fd73e8d88e321daaa28406d61\" data-ph=\"Editable Area. Backspace tab to remove this block.\" designmode=\"off\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n<div class=\"uk-overflow-container\"></div>\n<!--EndFragment-->                       \n                        <div style=\"line-height: 1em;\">\n<font class=\"\" style=\"\"><!--EndFragment--><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.2em; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\"><font style=\"font-size: 24px;\" color=\"#011178\" class=\"\" face=\"Georgia\">C<font style=\"\">ertification Pathway Options</font></font></span><br></p></font><div style=\"\"><div style=\"line-height: normal;\">\n<div style=\"line-height: normal;\">\n<div style=\"line-height: normal;\">\n<div style=\"line-height: normal;\">\n<font class=\"\"><font class=\"\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\" color=\"#011ca0\" class=\"\"><br></font></span></div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\">\n<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font style=\"\" class=\"\" color=\"#011178\"><b>Option A</b></font></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font style=\"\" class=\"\" color=\"#999999\">\n\n</font></span></div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\">\n<!--StartFragment--><div style=\"text-align: start; line-height: normal;\"><font style=\"line-height: 1.2em;\"><font color=\"#011ca0\" class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 16px;\">_________________</span><br></font></font></div>\n<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><!--EndFragment-->\n</div>\n<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\" class=\"\">Interested participants with at least a Bachelor’s degree are required to sit for the entire certification course, which comprises of the following Modules.</font></span></p></font></font><p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" class=\"\" color=\"#000000\">Module 1 – Foundation in Financial Planning with Behavioural Psychology of Financial Planning (<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://fpam.org.my/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Syllabus-Topics-Module-1-Foundation-in-Financial-Planning-with-Behavioural-Psychology-of-FP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\" style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Download Syllabu</font>s</a>)&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"\" class=\"\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Module 2 – Insurance and Risk Management with Estate Planning (</span><font style=\"\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://fpam.org.my/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Syllabus-Topics-Module-2-Insurance-Planning-and-Estate-Planning.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Download Sylla</span><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">bus</font></a></font></font><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" class=\"\" color=\"#000000\">)&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"\" class=\"\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Module 3 – Investment Planning and Portfolio Management (</span><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://fpam.org.my/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Syllabus-Topics-Module-3-Investment-Planning-and-Portfolio-Management.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Download Syllab</span><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">us</font></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">)&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"\" class=\"\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Module 4 – Retirement Planning and Tax Planning (</span><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://fpam.org.my/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Syllabus-Topics-Module-4-Retirement-Taxation-Planning-Rev-1.0.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\" style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Download Syllabus</font></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">)&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Module 5 – Financial Plan Construction and Professional Responsibilities (</span><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" holdhref=\"https://fpam.org.my/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Syllabus-Topics-Module-5-Financial-Plan-Construction-and-Professional-Responsibilites.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"isLinks isWebsite\" style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Download Syllabus</font></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">)</span></font><br></font></p>\n<font class=\"\"><font class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\" class=\"\">The shortest time frame to complete the programme is 9 months.</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: inherit; box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\" class=\"\"><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></font></span></p>\n<ul class=\"disc\" style=\"margin: 15px 0px; padding-left: 30px; font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(8, 8, 8);\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><font color=\"#080808\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">For Non degree holder, if you have SPM qualification and at least 5 years of relevant work experience, you can sit for Prior Learning Recognition Assessment (PLRA) – a multiple-choice test. Once passed, you are eligible to apply for CFP programme. Candidates are only allowed to register for the PLRA assessment 2 times and there must be a break of 6 months between the attempts. If you are interested to take the exam, please contact Ms Fong Lai Peng from FPAM, at Email: laipeng@fpam.org.my or Tel: 03-7954 9500 to arrange for the exam.<br></font></li>\n<li><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">UTAR Degree student (Student from Bachelor of Finance and Bachelor of Banking &amp; Finance are exempted from Module 3).\n</font></li>\n</ul>\n<!--EndFragment--><div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\">\n<!--StartFragment--><div style=\"\">\n<!--StartFragment--><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(1, 17, 120);\"><b>Option B</b></span><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"color: rgb(110, 110, 110); font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"text-align: start;\"><font class=\"\" color=\"#999999\"></font></span></div>\n<div style=\"color: rgb(110, 110, 110); font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: start; line-height: normal;\"><font style=\"line-height: 1.2em;\"><font color=\"#011ca0\" class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 16px;\">\n\n</span><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 16px;\">_________________</span><!--EndFragment--><br></font></font></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\">\n<!--StartFragment--><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\" color=\"#080808\" class=\"\">FPAM recognises that certain professional qualifications cover partial components in financial planning. Holders of the following qualifications are granted exemption as listed below (terms &amp; conditions apply). Candidates are required to register for the Psychology topic before exam registration for Module 5.</font>\n</div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.2em; text-align: justify;\">\n<!--StartFragment-->\n\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTab